  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Duffey described AI as a key enabler and said adversaries are embracing it, requiring quick work to apply it operationally. He identified opportunities to apply AI internally at the Pentagon, including AI-enabled design and resource optimization. He said AI offers tremendous opportunity to accelerate and improve work and to enable operations, while noting less visibility and expertise in responsible deployment and operations. He separately cited specific and very great vulnerabilities associated with AI and the need for continued updates from companies.",
   "sids": [
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4",
    "s1"
   ],
