   "text": "So what I think about, in terms of how to accelerate and improve the way we do our work, I think there is tremendous opportunity for AI. And then, certainly, with respect to enabling operations and finding ways to apply it responsibly in the deployment of our systems and in our operations is an area where I have less visibility and expertise, but I know we are actively pursuing opportunities to enable the warfighter who can help us identify ways to apply it to improve how we win and fight wars.",
